<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Caspian starts Sigma.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Caspian starts Sigma.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Caspian Securities said it initiated coverage of Mexico's Sigma Alimentos SA de CV with a market performer rating.</p>
<p>- Analyst Kathleen Herman said Sigma's valuation already reflected the company's strong growth prospects.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
